# desc: 하위 부품을 가진 장비와 그 부품의 포인트는 무엇인가? — 부품 계층을 타는 공유 경로
# suite: core
# shared: true
# monotone: up
# expect-min: 1
PREFIX brick: <https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#>
PREFIX rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
SELECT ?equipment ?part ?point
WHERE {
  ?equipment a/rdfs:subClassOf* brick:Equipment .
  ?equipment brick:hasPart|^brick:isPartOf ?part .
  ?part a/rdfs:subClassOf* brick:Equipment .
  ?part brick:hasPoint|^brick:isPointOf ?point .
}
ORDER BY ?equipment ?part ?point
